story_ai.prompt:
Write a NEW children's story about: {theme}.
Use one or two of these recurring characters (refer to them in scenes ONLY with these exact placeholders): {characters}. Their names: benny = Benny the bunny, adam = Adam (boy), maya = Maya (his little sister), lina = Lina (girl).
Do not repeat these existing titles: {used}
Rules: 8 to 10 short narration sentences (max 16 words each), simple English, the first sentence must be an exciting hook, the last sentence states the lesson. Exactly 5 scenes: visual image descriptions in order, each one containing at least one placeholder like {{benny}}, no text in images.
Return JSON: {{"title": "Short catchy title with one emoji", "moral": "one sentence", "theme": "moral|islamic|adventure", "lines": [...], "scenes": [...]}}
